     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<ul class=\"d2u-list\"><li><strong>Garment Design</strong><br>Move from sketch and concept into production-ready artwork.</li><li><strong>Embroidery & Screen Printing</strong><br>Digitize designs, set up machines, and produce clean runs.</li><li><strong>Vinyl & Sublimation</strong><br>Weed, press, and finish custom apparel on-demand.</li><li><strong>Material Sourcing</strong><br>Pick the right blanks, inks, and threads for durable results.</li><li><strong>Launching a Line</strong><br>From prototype to small-batch production and go-to-market.</li></ul>"
